  "download_disabled": false,
  "description": "<p>This is the data and matlab code to prepare the figures for the \u00a0manuscript \"Visuomotor feedback tuning in the absence of visual error information\" by Sae Franklin and David Franklin.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>The three main programs to obtain the analysis are:</p>\n<p>df_analyze_RJ2_channeltrials_2.m</p>\n<p>df_analyze_RJ2_fieldtrials.m</p>\n<p>df_analyze_RJ2_visualpert.m<br>\n</p>\n<p>which will generate each of the figures in the results section of the manuscript.<br>\n</p>\n<p>Data files (.mat) are found within the datafiles.zip</p>\n<p>Additional code is found within helpfunctions.zip</p>\n<p><br></p>",
